    "-" : {
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "1. Open the Slack API site and create a new app.\n2. Under OAuth & Permissions, add the scope users.profile:write.\n3. Install to your workspace.\n4. Copy the \"User OAuth Token\" (starts with xoxp-).\n5. Paste it above and click Connect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Buka situs Slack API dan buat aplikasi baru.\n2. Di OAuth & Permissions, tambahkan scope users.profile:write.\n3. Pasang ke workspace-mu.\n4. Salin \"User OAuth Token\" (diawali xoxp-).\n5. Tempel di atas lalu klik Hubungkan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Quit Waqtu" : {
      "localizations" : {
